  "description": "NEW TO THE MARKET\n\nNO. 6 WOODLANDS, LOUGHGLYNN, CO. ROSCOMMON\n\nSPACIOUS 4 BEDROOM SEMI-DETACHED RESIDENCE ON A LARGE CORNER SITE\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this impressive 4-bedroom semi-detached residence situated on a large corner site on the outskirts of Loughglynn Village.\n\nFinished to a high standard throughout, this property offers spacious family accommodation in a convenient location within walking distance of all village amenities while enjoying easy access to Castlerea and Ballaghaderreen.\n\nAccommodation Comprises:\n\nEntrance Hall – 14'08\" x 6'06\"\nTiled floor, storage under stairs, staircase to first floor.\n\nSitting Room – 20'01\" x 12'08\"\nBay window, open fireplace with timber surround and granite hearth, fitted curtains, double French doors leading to kitchen/dining area.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room – 19'07\" x 11'06\"\nFully fitted kitchen, tiled floor and tiled splashback, patio doors leading to rear garden.\n\nUtility Room – 6'10\" x 5'06\"\nTiled floor, worktop and plumbed for appliances.\n\nGuest Toilet – 6'11\" x 4'05\"\nWC, WHB and fully tiled.\n\nLanding – 13'01\" x 6'11\"\nFitted carpet, hot press and attic access.\n\nBedroom 1 – 13'07\" x 9'05\"\nBay window, fitted wardrobes, wood flooring and curtains.\n\nEnsuite – 6'02\" x 4'09\"\nWC, WHB, electric shower, fully tiled floor and walls.\n\nBedroom 2 – 11'06\" x 9'07\"\nFitted wardrobes, wood flooring and curtains.\n\nBedroom 3 – 9'07\" x 6'02\"\nWood flooring, wardrobe and curtains.\n\nBedroom 4 – 8'10\" x 7'09\"\nFitted wardrobe and wood flooring.\n\nMain Bathroom – 7'01\" x 6'02\"\nWhite suite, fully tiled floor and walls.\n\nOutside\n\nLarge corner site\n\nBlock boundary wall to front\n\nTarmac driveway to front and side\n\nTimber fencing to side boundaries\n\nMature gardens to front and rear\n\nMains water and mains sewage\n\nExcellent road frontage\n\nAdditional land available to purchase separately to the rear, ideal for